{
  "id": "MaskedKeystoneProbe",
  "summary": "#1505 masked keystone, step 1: segment 2 as a masked regional edit, no argument",
  "description": "Stage #1506 of #1505 (plan v1). The keystone control's segment 2 alone (dense attention, seed 2, the shared segment 1's 22-frame tail as its guide), made an unchained fl2va regional edit: source_video is variable:keystone as one frame, then the tail (seg01 frames 170-191), then the tail's last frame held for the 169 frames left, since a masked source must be num_frames long (those frames are all regenerated); mask_video holds its first 22 frames black (kept) and the rest white (regenerated), the #1322 mask-22 construction, which pools to whole latent cells with mask_grow 0; refine_strength 1.0, image variable:keystone, hold_audio aud02. The mask's stills are the keystone flattened to one grey by grade (contrast 0), then pushed below (blacks -1, luma 112) or above (whites 1, luma 143) the 128 binarize threshold. Step 1 runs it with the bright keystone and no attention argument.",
  "shape": "shot",
  "variables": {
    "seed": 2,
    "seg01": "",
    "keystone": ""
  },
  "seed": "variable:seed",
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "tail01",
      "task": {
        "command": "trim_video",
        "arguments": {
          "video": "variable:seg01",
          "start_frame": 170,
          "num_frames": 22
        }
      },
      "result": {
        "content_type": "video/mp4",
        "save": false,
        "fps": 24
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "aud02",
      "task": {
        "command": "slice_audio",
        "arguments": {
          "audio": "asset:bench/constitution-narration-retimed.wav",
          "start_frame": 170,
          "num_frames": 192,
          "fps": 24
        }
      },
      "result": {
        "content_type": "audio/wav",
        "save": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "key02",
      "task": {
        "command": "stills_to_video",
        "arguments": {
          "images": [
            "variable:keystone"
          ],
          "durations": 0.0417,
          "fps": 24
        }
      },
      "result": {
        "content_type": "video/mp4",
        "save": false,
        "fps": 24
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "last01",
      "task": {
        "command": "get_frame",
        "arguments": {
          "video": "variable:seg01",
          "frame_index": 191
        }
      },
      "result": {
        "content_type": "image/png",
        "save": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "pad02",
      "task": {
        "command": "stills_to_video",
        "arguments": {
          "images": [
            "previous_result:last01"
          ],
          "durations": 7.041667,
          "fps": 24
        }
      },
      "result": {
        "content_type": "video/mp4",
        "save": false,
        "fps": 24
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "src02",
      "task": {
        "command": "concat_videos",
        "arguments": {
          "videos": [
            "previous_result:key02",
            "previous_result:tail01",
            "previous_result:pad02"
          ],
          "trim_frames": 0,
          "fps": 24
        }
      },
      "result": {
        "content_type": "video/mp4",
        "save": false,
        "fps": 24
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "black",
      "task": {
        "command": "grade",
        "arguments": {
          "media": "variable:keystone",
          "contrast": 0.0,
          "blacks": -1.0
        }
      },
      "result": {
        "content_type": "image/png",
        "save": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "white",
      "task": {
        "command": "grade",
        "arguments": {
          "media": "variable:keystone",
          "contrast": 0.0,
          "whites": 1.0
        }
      },
      "result": {
        "content_type": "image/png",
        "save": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "mask02",
      "task": {
        "command": "stills_to_video",
        "arguments": {
          "images": [
            "previous_result:black",
            "previous_result:white"
          ],
          "durations": [
            0.916667,
            7.083333
          ],
          "fps": 24
        }
      },
      "result": {
        "content_type": "video/mp4",
        "save": false,
        "fps": 24
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "seg02",
      "pipeline": {
        "configuration": {
          "component_type": "ModularPipeline",
          "pre_load_modules": [
            "sdnq"
          ],
          "load_components": {
            "dtype": "torch.bfloat16",
            "quantization_config": {
              "transformer": {
                "configuration": {
                  "config_type": "sdnq.SDNQConfig"
                },
                "arguments": {
                  "weights_dtype": "{int8}",
                  "quantization_device": "cuda",
                  "return_device": "cpu",
                  "use_quantized_matmul": true,
                  "dequantize_fp32": false,
                  "modules_to_not_convert": [
                    "proj_in",
                    "audio_proj_in",
                    "context_embedder",
                    "time_embedder",
                    "time_proj",
                    "token_refiner",
                    "norm_out",
                    "proj_out",
                    "audio_proj_out"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "text_encoder": {
                "configuration": {
                  "config_type": "sdnq.SDNQConfig"
                },
                "arguments": {
                  "weights_dtype": "{int8}",
                  "quantization_device": "cuda",
                  "return_device": "cpu",
                  "dequantize_fp32": false,
                  "modules_to_not_convert": [
                    ".model.visual",
                    "lm_head"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "vae": {
                "configuration": {
                  "config_type": "sdnq.SDNQConfig"
                },
                "arguments": {
                  "weights_dtype": "{int8}",
                  "quant_conv": true,
                  "use_quantized_matmul_conv": true,
                  "quantization_device": "cuda",
                  "return_device": "cpu",
                  "dequantize_fp32": false
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "components": {
            "transformer": {
              "group_offload": {
                "offload_type": "block_level",
                "num_blocks_per_group": 2,
                "use_stream": true,
                "record_stream": true,
                "low_cpu_mem_usage": true
              }
            },
            "text_encoder": {
              "remove_modules": [
                "lm_head"
              ]
            },
            "text_encoder.model": {
              "truncate_layers": {
                "language_model.layers": 51
              },
              "group_offload": {
                "offload_type": "leaf_level"
              }
            },
            "vae": {
              "device": "cuda",
              "residency": "on_demand"
            },
            "audio_vae": {
              "device": "cuda",
              "residency": "on_demand"
            }
          }
        },
        "from_pretrained_arguments": {
          "model_name": "MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3",
          "workflow": "fl2va"
        },
        "scheduler": {
          "shift": 12.0
        },
        "audio_scheduler": {
          "shift": 3.0
        },
        "arguments": {
          "prompt": "For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, photorealistic, one continuous shot that carries over without a break from the previous shot. The shot opens exactly on <Picture 1>: a close-up from the top of the shoulders up of the woman in <Picture 1>, centred, with close-cropped silver natural hair, small gold stud earrings, a charcoal grey wool overcoat over a cream turtleneck and a deep burgundy wool scarf, the bare elm-lined gravel path and the pale neoclassical stone building softly out of focus behind her, in soft overcast late-afternoon light with a muted earthy grade. She walks slowly and steadily toward the camera, which travels backward on a smooth dolly at exactly her walking pace, her eyes level on the lens, her face composed and grave. Preserving the speaker's face, clothing, framing and the setting exactly, the camera holds its framing for the whole shot: it never pushes in, and the speaker stays the same size in frame from the first frame to the last. (S1), a Black American woman in her mid-sixties with a low, warm alto voice that carries the settled weight of age, a faint natural huskiness, a slow, measured, serious delivery with clear diction and quiet resolve, never theatrical, at the same quiet level and unhurried pace as before, is already speaking and continues mid-flow, lips and jaw shaping every word clearly and in time with the sound: <d>[English] insure domestic Tranquility, provide for the common defence, promote the general Welfare, and secure the</d> The delivery carries straight on to the end of the shot, with no pause to start over.\n\noverall_soundscape: Quiet open-air park ambience under her voice: a soft steady breeze through the bare elm branches, the slow, even crunch of her shoes on the gravel, faint distant birdsong. The ambience runs under the voice throughout and never drops out.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
          "hold_audio": "previous_result:aud02",
          "num_frames": 192,
          "width": 1344,
          "height": 768,
          "num_inference_steps": 20,
          "output": [
            "videos",
            "audio",
            "sampling_rate"
          ],
          "image": "variable:keystone",
          "guides": [
            {
              "video": "previous_result:tail01",
              "frame": 0
            }
          ],
          "source_video": "previous_result:src02",
          "mask_video": "previous_result:mask02",
          "mask_grow": 0,
          "refine_strength": 1.0
        },
        "seed": 2
      },
      "result": {
        "content_type": "video/mp4",
        "fps": 24,
        "subfolder": "segments"
      }
    }
  ]
}
